Z||000010||REDHOTT88||12-17-2001||10:53 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 72vinman:<BR><B>  I think it is just as bad as some people on here, starting numerous other threads with no significant Fiero or social value at all.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE>Like say... the 1000 post thread?<P>If that's fun to you, go ahead. I believe this is called the FORUM and you should talk about what you like, as long as you post in the right category...<P>Sometimes people who post, may not be the "All-Mighty Fiero Expert God from Heaven", such as yourself, and might post things to stay in the game and keep things going, for they don't have the EXTENSIVE knowledge as some one of your majestic caliber.<P> As they learn more about the Fiero.. maybe the posts will become contributive.<P><P>------------------<BR>                                                                                                         <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/FIREdevil.gif">       <FONT COLOR="ffoooo"> <B>1988 Formula 2.8L</B> V6 5 speed </FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1">(Runs smooth, shifts crisp, red and shiny all over!)</FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000011||TRiAD||12-17-2001||11:03 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 72vinman:<BR><B>...I have seen people on here with almost 1000 posts in three or four months since they have been registered and I can pretty much guarantee that the majority of it has been complete fluff...get in touch with me I got a few other things I would like to rant about.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Well, I haven't been here all that long, and I've surpassed 1000 posts. If you have a rant about any of my threads or posts, please let me know. I don't believe I've posted any "fluff", but you can point it out if I'm mistaken. <P>For the record, I agree the "1000 post" thread was lame, and this is why some forums have quit posting post numbers, although I hope we don't do that here. It's nice to know who the "old-timers" are. <BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0NgAAAMsSN*Wryq60N*CeWB!hXjfeIaMEc1YxPH9aPzaIXm!17ZpdBFE0Yk*d*dHNFG*GR3SFyLa8KJgh1IKe2Q/xmas-sig.jpg">       <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="red">Merry Christmas!</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">Project MR1 ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</B><BR>Photoshop rendition of planned modifications<BR>AIM ~ Michael Blue 72</I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000012||72vinman||12-17-2001||11:36 AM||||LZeitgeist - I was trying to say that there is always been and will be threads that don't have much meaning (broken donut, pine freshener, etc) but they are fun and people seem to have a good time with them. So if we starting banning all threads that seem to be a waste of bandwidth, then the forum would not be as much fun as it is now. For the amount of information I receive off of this forum I am willing to pay a yearly or monthly fee if Cliff needs the funds to ensure we all have a place to come back to.<P><BR>/QUOTE]If that's fun to you, go ahead. I believe this is called the FORUM and you should talk about what you like, as long as you post in the right category...<BR>[/B][/QUOTE]<BR>REDHOTT88- That is exactly my point. This is a forum. It is expected you will receive many posts many which you will learn from, many you will not agree with, and many you could not care less about.However, if someone would like to complain about something they better make sure they are innocent of the same thing. My point is that it was in the right category and people were just clowning around. By the way the references you made about me are in no way reflective of my true character. I apologize if it seemed that way but sometimes I have to rant.<P>Triad -  I was in no way referring to you. I actually have enjoyed reading many of your posts. I printed off the "Harry Potter" thread a few days ago for some reading material while I was in some boring meetings at work.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> The couple of people I was talking about know who they are and have already sent me an email. <P>Happy Holidays to all of you.||||reg||1
